ander</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diversity and sources of rapidly growing mycobacteria associated with infections following cardiac surgery</article-title><source>J Infect Dis</source><year>1989</year><volume>159</volume><fpage>708</fpage><lpage>716</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2926161</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Santos</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Oliveira</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Fernandes</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gon&#x000e7;alves</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Macieira</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Cadete</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection and identification of mycobacteria in the Lisbon water distribution system</article-title><source>Water Sci Technol</source><year>2005</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>177</fpage><lpage>180</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16312965</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barbeau</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gauthier</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Payment</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biofilms, infectious agents, and dental unit waterlines: a review</article-title><source>Can J Microbiol</source><year>1998</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>1019</fpage><lpage>1028</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10029997</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1139/cjm-44-11-1019</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esteban</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Mart&#x000ed;n-de-Hijas</surname><give